as, farmácias e diversos serviços.\n\nAgende sua visita e conheça pessoalmente este apartamento.\n\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a alteração sem aviso prévio. Consulte nossos corretores.\n\n#Curitiba #Bigorrilho #CrystalLakeResidence #ApartamentoCuritiba #VarandaGourmet #ImoveisCuritiba #MyBrokerImoveis25:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"details\":{\"id\":\"0a8d8d48-51d2-4d42-98aa-d56e9bd7f06f\",\"co","fotos":["https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183645/IMG_0635_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183656/IMG_0624_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183656/IMG_0625_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183645/IMG_0627_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183645/IMG_0630_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183645/IMG_0629_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183649/IMG_0639_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183647/IMG_0643_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183648/IMG_0640_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183647/IMG_0650_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183647/IMG_0654_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261111183648/IMG_0656_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CR